    choices: {"A": "Achieve a pulmonary artery occlusion pressure of greater than 15 mm Hg", "B": "Achieve a central venous pressure (CVP) of 15 mm Hg or higher", "C": "Achieve a mixed venous saturation of 70% or higher", "D": "Achieve a mean arterial pressure (MAP) of 80 mm Hg or higher"},
