    choices: {"A": "15 compressions: 2 ventilations, at least 100 compressions/ minute", "B": "30 compressions: 2 ventilations, no more than 120 compressions/ minute", "C": "Continuous chest compressions at a rate of 100 to 120 com- pressions/minute with 10 breaths per minute (asynchronous ventilation)", "D": "100–120 compressions/minute without ventilations (“hands- only” CPR)"},
    correctAnswer: "C",
