    explanation: "Current guidelines from the American Society of Anesthesiolo- gists (ASA) and the American Society of Regional Anesthesia and Pain Medicine (ASRA) recommend the ready availability and immediate administration of intralipid for LAST. The intralipid is administered as a bolus dose followed by an infusion and frequently results in return of spontaneous circulation (ROSC).",
