    title: "A 16-year-old male with a spinal cord injury is being re-admitted to the pediatric intensive care...",
    scenario: "A 16-year-old male with a spinal cord injury is being re-admitted to the pediatric intensive care unit from the rehabilitation unit for intubation and mechanical ventilation secondary to nosocomial pneumonia. In preparing for the intubation, the bedside nurse asks if you would like her to draw up succinylcho- line. Which of the following would be your best response to his suggestion?",
