    category: "PICU MCQ Review",
    title: "A child who is recovering from surgical repair of an atrioventricular canal defect develops a tachya...",
    scenario: "A child who is recovering from surgical repair of an atrioventricular canal defect develops a tachyarrhythmia with a rate of 160 beats/min. It is uncertain whether this is an atrial tachycardia or a junctional ectopic tachycardia. The best diagnostic test would be",
    choices: {"A": "administration of adenosine with continuous recording of the rhythm strip", "B": "standard 12-lead ECG", "C": "echocardiography", "D": "overdrive pacing at a rate of 170/min", "E": "atrial ECG"},
